# Lie in Wait: Bot1's Alpine Grizzly (4/2) dies to its own Lightning Bolt. Lie in Wait then returns it to Bot1's hand and deals damage equal
# to its power, 4, to Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2), which dies. A noncreature card in Bot1's graveyard (the Bolt) and a creature card in Bot2's
# graveyard (the Bolt, no creature card) is no legal first target.

